 "note": "PCBL reports four Ind AS 108 segments: Carbon Black, Power (co-generation from tail gas; part sold to the grid, part used captively and eliminated as inter-segment revenue), Chemicals (Aquapharm, acquired Jan-2024) and Battery Chemical (Nanovace, pre-revenue). Management, the rating agencies and brokers track the business as (1) carbon black including power, measured by EBITDA per tonne of carbon black sold, and (2) Aquapharm (Specialty & Solutions) revenue and EBITDA. Our model follows that split: cbRev = consolidated revenue less Aquapharm (Chemicals segment) revenue; cbEbitda = Screener EBITDA (excludes other income) less Aquapharm EBITDA as disclosed by the company. Corporate costs and Nanovace spend therefore sit in the carbon-black line. Volumes in tonnes; ₹ crore otherwise.",
